        "npcName": "Engineer Linh",
        "dialogues": [
          "Hello An, the smart robot. I'm Linh, an agricultural engineer. Welcome to the farming zone!",
          "This is a cultivation area in the Mekong Delta, which is currently facing a small problem.",
          "Let's work together to help local farmers cultivate, protect their crops, and care for their livestock.",
          "The rain will help the plants grow. Stay focused on farming!",
          "Keep farming and harvesting quickly. And don't forget to choose the right crops and livestock for the saline and drought conditions.",
          "Alright, let’s get going!"
        ]
